{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_kirara_set_2_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_kirara_set_2",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "無傷通關",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_kirara_2_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "1acb5fa45476989db3eb1312aeae46c0e62d661da7dc31bbceb6c036a5a55c76",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "緊張的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "text": "她們怎麼樣了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "急躁的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "text": "那個領隊的姑娘被那群強盜從背後砍了一刀，現在還昏著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "急躁的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "text": "那麼多人偷襲人家一個，沒種的東西！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "緊張的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "text": "那、那我們現在怎麼辦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "急躁的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "text": "你問怎麼辦？那群混帳要搶的是我們的藥，那他們就是要我們的命！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "急躁的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "text": "大不了我和他們拼了！我也能用法術......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "緊張的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "text": "他們那都是騙人的！我們連想點個火都不成，就算想拼命，也拼不過啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "急躁的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "text": "拼不過也得拼！難道要把我們好不容易買到的藥，就這麼讓那群殺千刀的搶去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "急躁的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "text": "我們費了多大功夫才買到這麼一批便宜的抑制藥！要是沒有這些，你，我，村子裡的其他人，你看看我們還能帶著身上的破石頭活幾天！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "急躁的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "text": "況且，還有羅德島的人在......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "緊張的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "text": "但是，羅德島只是送藥來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "緊張的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "text": "你搞清楚，藥送到我們手上了，她們隨時都能走，她們不會幫我們的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "緊張的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "text": "就算她們真的留下......就連那個能輕鬆對付野獸的領隊都傷成那樣，剩下那幾個小姑娘，能成什麼事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "急躁的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "緊張的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "text": "那群強盜沒搶到東西，肯定不會善罷甘休，說不準他們馬上就要打過來了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "緊張的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "text": "與其大家一起完蛋，還不如他們想要什麼就給他們什麼，我們、我們總能再想辦法！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "緊張的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "text": "仔細想想，這個什麼羅德島，他們的藥賣得這麼便宜，誰知道是真是假......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "急躁的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "text": "夠了！你少說兩句！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "緊張的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "text": "呃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "急躁的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "text": "那幾個送藥來的姑娘幫我們趕走附近野獸的時候，那個醫生姑娘幫你做檢查的時候，你可沒說過這種混帳話！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "急躁的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "text": "我們才付了多少錢，值得人家特地送藥過來，還帶了個醫生來給我們免費看病？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "急躁的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "text": "這個羅德島都能做到這個地步，就算這藥真不起效，我也認了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "緊張的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "緊張的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "text": "......那你說，我們真的能守住這些藥嗎......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "急躁的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "text": "......總要試試。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "急躁的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "text": "行了，我還要去給羅德島的人幫忙，你也給自己找點事做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "緊張的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "text": "好吧。早上有個姑娘拜託我幫忙，還差一點才完成，我去喊上其他人一起......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "（不妙。再這麼下去不妙啊。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "（隊長受傷未恢復，治療也需要一段時間，現在只剩下一個輸出職業和我這種派不上太大用場的輔助角色......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "（啊，不對，不行。不能在這麼嚴肅的場合用遊戲思維。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "（但是......確實難辦。難辦了......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "嘆什麼氣呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "哇啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "呼，什麼啊，是宴啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "是我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "（下次麻煩別一聲不吭出現在別人背後，很嚇人欸。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "（忍者嗎你......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "嚇到你了？抱歉啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "不過我可不是什麼忍者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "啊？欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "（為什麼會知道我在想什麼......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "（莫非是......讀心術？！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "也沒有什麼超能力哦，你的表情，太明顯啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "（......騙人，真的能猜到？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "真的真的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "（......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "（好方便，可以不用說話了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "哎，慢著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "綺良同學，“對話”還是需要把心裡想的說出來才成立的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "還是說你是想讓我一直緊盯著你不放？嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "好啦，不開玩笑了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "我要去看看赤冬的情況，一會再聊~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "等一下，宴！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "我也和你一起去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "那個啊，宴......你覺得我們現在的情況如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "嗯......挺糟糕的吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "本以為只是普通的送貨任務，我們這邊也沒做太多準備。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "雖然是配好了小隊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "但我們的戰鬥主力隊長小姐不慎被暗算了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "笑不出來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "一般的強盜其實完全不是我的對手哦，不過他們人數太多，我一個人還是有點應付不來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "醫生小姐不參加戰鬥，至於綺良你嘛......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "別看我，我是後勤技術人員。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "啊，是嗎？總感覺我認識的技術人員都還挺能打的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "而且，我記得你不是挺擅長那種戰略遊戲嗎？上回還和博士一起刷新了什麼紀錄來著？這麼看，說不定你也會很適合當指揮官。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "怎麼樣，要不要試試看？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "別開玩笑了，現實可不是遊戲，我......我不行的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "快點去看看赤冬的情況吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "唔......隨便否定自己可不好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "而且，明明應該是有什麼想法了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "不誠實哦，綺良同學。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜莓",
      "speakerId": "avg_449_glider_1",
      "text": "傷口沒有大礙，消炎藥也已經用過了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜莓",
      "speakerId": "avg_449_glider_1",
      "text": "雖然現在還沒有醒來，但只要不再發熱，好好靜養的話，後續應該不會有什麼危險。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "是嗎......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "那太好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "不過，我們的隊長小姐還要睡多久？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜莓",
      "speakerId": "avg_449_glider_1",
      "text": "這就要看赤冬小姐自身的體質了。雖然已經盡力治療，但當時的傷口很深......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜莓",
      "speakerId": "avg_449_glider_1",
      "text": "就算能醒來，也沒辦法立刻繼續作戰吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "嗯？搞不好可以？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜莓&綺良",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不可以！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "唉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "我之前放出的偵測設備顯示，那夥強盜一直沒有離開這附近。雖然我已經聯繫了在附近的小隊，但他們趕過來也需要時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "如果強盜趁現在進攻，我們恐怕......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "恐怕就都完蛋了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "那現在怎麼辦？是不是先帶著隊長小姐撤退比較好？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜莓",
      "speakerId": "avg_449_glider_1",
      "text": "可是，我們離開的話，這裡的感染者該怎麼辦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜莓",
      "speakerId": "avg_449_glider_1",
      "text": "雖說把藥送到，我們的任務就完成了，但我做不到就這樣把村裡的人丟下不管......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "嗯......我們把藥也一起帶走？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "先不提對方會不會相信，我覺得那些強盜要搶的可不止是藥。這裡的人對上強盜，完全沒有還手之力欸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜莓",
      "speakerId": "avg_449_glider_1",
      "text": "確實......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "那個啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "其實，我覺得我們可以——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "急躁的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "text": "打擾了，我給你們拿了點吃的過來......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "急躁的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "text": "小地方沒什麼好東西，幾位將就著吃點吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜莓",
      "speakerId": "avg_449_glider_1",
      "text": "謝謝，我們不要緊。之前的襲擊，村裡有沒有人受傷？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "急躁的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "text": "多虧了幾位小姐，我們都沒事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "急躁的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "text": "這位隊長閣下的傷勢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜莓",
      "speakerId": "avg_449_glider_1",
      "text": "不用擔心，已經沒有危險了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "急躁的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "text": "啊，啊，那真是太好了......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "急躁的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "text": "對了，還有這個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "急躁的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "text": "這是小姐們要的，這附近的地形圖......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "嗯？地形圖？我沒聽說過這回事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜莓",
      "speakerId": "avg_449_glider_1",
      "text": "也不是我要的......難道是赤冬小姐之前拜託的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "......是我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "謝謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "道謝的聲音幾不可聞。\n自村民進入屋內就一直保持沉默的女孩像是急著逃避眾人視線一般，低頭將目光投向接到手裡的幾張圖。\n由在荒野上建起村落的感染者們親手繪製的圖片，粗糙簡陋，有些甚至只畫了幾筆抽象的線條來示意，並不能真正稱得上是地形圖。\n想要從這樣的圖上汲取正確的資訊並不容易。\n而緊捏著圖紙的東國女孩，卻像是一個真正經驗豐富的老手一樣，快速地翻動著手中的紙張。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "（地形很平坦，對我們這邊很不利。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "（不過也不是沒有可以利用的地方......比如說這裡，如果能在這邊做一些佈置的話......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "（方案是可行的，但是......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "怎麼樣，看出什麼了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "我說，綺良同學~看你的樣子，你應該有什麼點子了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "急躁的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "text": "什麼？！真的嗎？小姑娘你......不對！小姐你有辦法了嗎？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "我、我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "......我覺得我們......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無聊的男生",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "她到底想說什麼？結結巴巴的，說不出來就趕快下台。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無聊的男生",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "真是浪費時間......就她這個音量誰聽得清啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻薄的女生",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "就是說啊，聽說她初中的時候缺勤到差點留級欸，完全不來上課，大家都猜測可能是犯了什麼事，被學校停學了呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻薄的女生",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嘻，好像還喜歡那種塑膠小人哦，在家裡不會偷偷幹什麼下流的事情吧？哇......真糟糕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "八卦的學生",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "她的名字也太不適合她了吧？本來還以為會是更閃亮一點的美少女，結果感覺是很陰沉的人嘛，真掃興。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "八卦的學生",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "臉？她都不怎麼抬頭，誰知道臉長得怎麼樣啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憂慮的教師",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "雲母同學，學校認為不能再容許你像初中那樣缺席課程了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憂慮的教師",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "如果你還是沒有辦法適應校園生活，我們可能會考慮與你的家長交流一下，關於留級，甚至是退學的問題......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "不行......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "我、我不......不知道......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "（喘不上氣......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "（我在幹什麼啊？快點好好說話啊，這裡又不是學校......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "呃，啊......我想說的是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "緊張的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "text": "不、不好了！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "緊張的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "text": "強盜！強盜又來了！他們圍在村口，還打傷了人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "急躁的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "text": "什麼？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜莓",
      "speakerId": "avg_449_glider_1",
      "text": "有人受傷？在哪裡，麻煩你立刻帶我過去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "沒辦法了，我也一起去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "喂，綺良。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "不要讓大家等太久哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "（宴那傢伙，說得好像很懂的樣子。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "（什麼啊，我自己都還沒搞懂呢......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "（不行，不能就在這傻站著，總之得做點什麼才行！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "疼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "噫！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "別大驚小怪的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_475_akafyu_1",
      "text": "嘶......疼疼疼，扯到傷口了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "赤冬你醒了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "傷口怎麼樣，感覺還好嗎？不不不不要亂動啦！快點躺下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "你快躺回去，我現在就去喊蜜莓過來——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_475_akafyu_1",
      "text": "回來，不用喊人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_475_akafyu_1",
      "text": "我還撐得住......其實剛才我就醒了，剛剛你們說的我都聽見了，只不過身體有點不聽使喚，問題不大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_475_akafyu_1",
      "text": "那群偷襲我的混帳自己送上門最好！看我砍了他們！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_475_akafyu_1",
      "text": "唔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_475_akafyu_1",
      "text": "嘖......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "問題很大！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "別亂來了！哇啊啊傷口又滲血了......別動，把刀放下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "你現在的狀態根本不能戰鬥啊！你以為你是什麼格鬥遊戲主人公，只要血條不空就不影響行動嗎，啊？？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_475_akafyu_1",
      "text": "......嘁，你這不是挺能說的嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_475_akafyu_1",
      "text": "那你說怎麼辦，我不去的話，宴那邊恐怕撐不住。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_475_akafyu_1",
      "text": "還是說你有什麼辦法？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "我、我想了一些，但是我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "我覺得不行......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_475_akafyu_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_475_akafyu_1",
      "text": "你這傢伙，到底在害怕什麼啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "什麼？我沒有......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_475_akafyu_1",
      "text": "你有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_475_akafyu_1",
      "text": "有想法就直說，行不行作為隊長的我會判斷！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_475_akafyu_1",
      "text": "憑什麼說自己不行？這次隊員可是我親自挑的，你這是在說我的眼光不行？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "等等，我不是我沒有......你這是強詞奪理！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_475_akafyu_1",
      "text": "啊，沒錯。怎麼，你有意見就說出來讓我聽聽啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "（唔唔唔——）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "（怎麼回事啊這個人——！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_475_akafyu_1",
      "text": "我看你不是挺會制定策略的嘛，在這方面，我可一次都沒贏過你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "但那是遊戲......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_475_akafyu_1",
      "text": "都差不多，我記得你不是還和博士那傢伙討論過戰術指揮？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "可是那也是遊戲的話題啊......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_475_akafyu_1",
      "text": "現實能用的博士也教了你不少吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_475_akafyu_1",
      "text": "少磨磨蹭蹭的！爽快點！一句話，幹不幹？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_475_akafyu_1",
      "text": "都說了做判斷的人是我！現在我就是你的大將，你是我的軍師，還不快快獻計！"
    },
    {
