      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "緊張的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "text": "真的嗎？！太好了......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "緊張的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "text": "這小盒子竟然能有這種威力......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_475_akafyu_1",
      "text": "嗚哇，效果是不是好得過分了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜莓",
      "speakerId": "avg_449_glider_1",
      "text": "確、確實！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜莓",
      "speakerId": "avg_449_glider_1",
      "text": "剛剛按下開關，周圍忽然出現施放源石技藝的聲音的時候，連我都嚇了一跳呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_475_akafyu_1",
      "text": "利用提前架設的投影設備威嚇敵人，虧那傢伙想得出來......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_475_akafyu_1",
      "text": "而且還是在這麼短的時間內就佈置完畢，到底是怎麼做到的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "緊張的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "text": "呃，這個機器，是那個粉頭髮的小姐早上的時候拜託我們安置的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_475_akafyu_1",
      "text": "啊？早上？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_475_akafyu_1",
      "text": "等會，那不是我們剛發現強盜活動，還什麼都沒發生的時候嗎？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_475_akafyu_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_475_akafyu_1",
      "text": "博士到底都教了她些什麼啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "時間到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精明的強盜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "text": "你做了什麼？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精明的強盜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "text": "地陷......嘖，是想困住我們嗎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "粗野的強盜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_008",
      "text": "救命！我要被埋住了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精明的強盜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "text": "小姑娘！你不管其他人的死活了嗎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精明的強盜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "text": "就算你把我們都解決掉，村子那邊也——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "好囉嗦......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "我要的是無傷通關。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精明的強盜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "你們不可能無視我這麼明顯的誘餌，就算不完全相信，至少也會分一部分人來追擊，這就足夠了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "用我這個不影響大局的輔助來困住一部分人，削減你們的人數，村子那邊留下攻擊力比較強的宴，應該就有辦法應付。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "況且還有投影......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "等會，我和你解釋這麼多幹什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "解釋自己的計畫是反派才會幹的事，搞不好就會被翻盤，不行不行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精明的強盜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "text": "你到底在自言自語些什麼亂七八糟的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "中了束縛DEBUFF的人別插嘴！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "嗨，綺良同學，聽得到嗎~"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_475_akafyu_1",
      "text": "喂宴，你別說廢話！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_475_akafyu_1",
      "text": "綺良，幹得好！我們這邊順利解決了，你那裡怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜莓",
      "speakerId": "avg_449_glider_1",
      "text": "綺良你沒有受傷吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "......嘿嘿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "沒有啦，我沒有受傷。這邊也很順利。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "咳咳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "綺良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "一切都在......我的計畫之中！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
